  "title": "Pasta Broccoli Bake",
  "description": "Make a rich and filling broccoli bake with a savory cheese sauce of butter, flour, milk, Parmesan and sharp Cheddar. Add garlic salt, nutmeg and thyme, combine with cooked broccoli and pasta, then bake with a grating of Swiss cheese over the top.",
  "authors": [
    "Donna"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-02-28T12:20:34-05:00",
